{"step_index":50,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-10T10:26:40Z","input_tokens":10330,"cache_read_tokens":151297,"output_tokens":4739,"thinking":"Planning updates to the HTML and CSS to ensure all required components from the specified sections are displayed without including any external API references. The goal is a clean presentation of the sections within the visualizer.\n\n\nFocus is now on structuring the layout. The header controls, input playground, code editor, and execution visualizer need to be arranged effectively. Thinking about the HTML structure to accommodate all required UI elements.\n\n\nConsidering how to represent the Algorithm Purpose & Execution Summary banner, metrics row, and the Actual Operation Visualizer card within the layout.  The Variable Inspector will need a live table, array visualization, and history inspector. The Built-In Code Questions panel is also required.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n  <title>Code Flow Visualizer — Learn Coding Step by Step (Rule-Based Execution Engine)</title>\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\" />\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <!-- Top Header & Execution Controls (Section 5) -->\n  <header class=\"app-header\">\n    <div class=\"brand\">\n      <div class=\"brand-logo\">PY</div>\n      <div class=\"brand-title\">\n        Code Flow Visualizer\n        <span class=\"brand-tag\">100% Rule-Based Execution Tracer • Offline Ready</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"transport-controls\" role=\"toolbar\" aria-label=\"Execution Controls\">\n      <button id=\"btnStart\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" title=\"Start automatic execution\">▶ Start</button>\n      <button id=\"btnPause\" class=\"btn\" title=\"Pause execution\" disabled>⏸ Pause</button>\n      <button id=\"btnResume\" class=\"btn\" title=\"Resume execution\" disabled>⏯ Resume</button>\n      <button id=\"btnPrev\" class=\"btn\" title=\"Previous Step (Left Arrow)\">◀ Previous Step</button>\n      <button id=\"btnNext\" class=\"btn btn-accent\" title=\"Next Step (Right Arrow)\">Next Step ▶</button>\n      <button id=\"btnRestart\" class=\"btn\" title=\"Restart from Step 1\">↺ Restart</button>\n\n      <div class=\"scrubber-wrap\">\n        <span id=\"stepBadge\" class=\"step-badge\">Step 1 / 1</span>\n        <input id=\"timelineSlider\" type=\"range\" class=\"timeline-slider\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" value=\"0\" aria-label=\"Execution Progress Indicator\" />\n      </div>\n\n      <select id=\"speedSelect\" class=\"speed-select\" aria-label=\"Playback Speed\">\n        <option value=\"1600\">0.5x Speed</option>\n        <option value=\"950\" selected>1.0x Speed</option>\n        <option value=\"500\">2.0x Speed</option>\n        <option value=\"220\">4.0x Speed</option>\n      </select>\n\n      <button id=\"btnPracticeMode\" class=\"btn\" title=\"Predict next variable value or condition result\">Practice Mode: OFF</button>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <!-- Input Playground Bar (Section 11) -->\n  <section class=\"input-playground-bar\" aria-label=\"Input Playground\">\n    <div class=\"playground-left\">\n      <span class=\"playground-label\">Input Playground:</span>\n      <input id=\"inputPlaygroundField\" type=\"text\" class=\"playground-input\" value=\"nums = [-2, 1, -3, 4, -1, 2, 1, -5, 4]\" spellcheck=\"false\" aria-label=\"Custom Input Expression\" />\n      <button id=\"btnRunInput\" class=\"btn btn-accent\">Run with Input</button>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"playground-presets\">\n      <span class=\"playground-label\">Quick Inputs:</span>\n      <button class=\"btn-chip\" data-input=\"nums = [-2, 1, -3, 4, -1, 2, 1, -5, 4]\">Default (→ 6)</button>\n      <button class=\"btn-chip\" data-input=\"nums = [-5, -2, -8]\">All Negative [-5, -2, -8] (→ -2)</button>\n      <button class=\"btn-chip\" data-input=\"nums = [1, 2, 3, 4]\">All Positive [1, 2, 3, 4] (→ 10)</button>\n      <button class=\"btn-chip\" data-input=\"nums = [7]\">Single [7] (→ 7)</button>\n      <button class=\"btn-chip\" data-input=\"nums = []\">Empty [] (Test Validation)</button>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Upper 3-Column Workspace (Panels A, B, C) -->\n  <main class=\"upper-workspace\">\n\n    <!-- ==========================================\n         PANEL A: CODE EDITOR (LEFT)\n         ========================================== -->\n    <section class=\"panel\" aria-label=\"Panel A: Code Editor\">\n      <div class=\"panel-header\">\n        <div class=\"panel-title\">Panel A: Code Editor</div>\n        <div class=\"panel-toolbar\">\n          <select id=\"presetSelect\" class=\"select-input\" aria-label=\"Select Example Program\"></select>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"editor-subbar\">\n        <div class=\"panel-toolbar\">\n          <button id=\"btnLoadExample\" class=\"btn\">Load Example</button>\n          <button id=\"btnEditCode\" class=\"btn\">Edit Code</button>\n          <button id=\"btnReset\" class=\"btn\">Reset</button>\n        </div>\n        <button id=\"btnAnalyzeCode\" class=\"btn btn-accent\">Analyze Code</button>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"line-state-legend\">\n        <span class=\"legend-pill\"><span class=\"legend-swatch swatch-current\"></span>Current Line</span>\n        <span class=\"legend-pill\"><span class=\"legend-swatch swatch-executed\"></span>Executed</span>\n        <span class=\"legend-pill\"><span class=\"legend-swatch swatch-next\"></span>Next Line</span>\n        <span class=\"legend-pill\"><span class=\"legend-swatch swatch-upcoming\"></span>Upcoming</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Validation / Syntax Error Alert Banner -->\n      <div id=\"validationBanner\" class=\"validation-banner hidden\"></div>\n\n      <div class=\"editor-main-area\">\n        <!-- Trace Line Highlighting View -->\n        <div id=\"codeLinesContainer\" class=\"code-lines-container\"></div>\n\n        <!-- Editable Source Code View -->\n        <div id=\"liveEditorWrap\" class=\"live-editor-wrap hidden\">\n          <div id=\"editorLineNumbers\" class=\"editor-line-numbers\">1</div>\n          <textarea id=\"codeTextarea\" class=\"code-textarea\" spellcheck=\"false\" placeholder=\"Paste or write supported Python code here...\"></textarea>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- ==========================================\n         PANEL B: EXECUTION VISUALIZER (CENTER)\n         ========================================== -->\n    <section class=\"panel\" aria-label=\"Panel B: Execution Visualizer\">\n      <div class=\"panel-header\">\n        <div class=\"panel-title\">Panel B: Execution Visualizer</div>\n        <span id=\"flowEventBadge\" class=\"brand-tag\">CLASS_DEF</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"flow-panel-content\">\n        <!-- Algorithm Purpose & Execution Summary -->\n        <div id=\"algorithmPurposeBox\" class=\"purpose-banner\"></div>\n\n        <!-- Practice Mode Prediction Box (when enabled) -->\n        <div id=\"practiceCard\" class=\"practice-card hidden\">\n          <div class=\"flow-mini-label\" style=\"color:var(--accent-purple);\">🎯 Practice Mode — Predict Before Revealing</div>\n          <div id=\"practicePrompt\" class=\"flow-step-explanation\"></div>\n          <div id=\"practiceOptions\" class=\"practice-options\"></div>\n          <div id=\"practiceFeedback\" class=\"flow-mini-content hidden\"></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Key Step Metrics -->\n        <div class=\"flow-status-grid\">\n          <div class=\"metric-box\">\n            <span class=\"metric-label\">Step Number</span>\n            <span id=\"metricStep\" class=\"metric-value\">1 / 1</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"metric-box\">\n            <span class=\"metric-label\">Current Line</span>\n            <span id=\"metricCurrentLine\" class=\"metric-value highlight-blue\">Line 1</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"metric-box\">\n            <span class=\"metric-label\">Loop Iteration</span>\n            <span id=\"metricLoopIter\" class=\"metric-value highlight-cyan\">None</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"metric-box\">\n            <span class=\"metric-label\">Next Line</span>\n            <span id=\"metricNextLine\" class=\"metric-value highlight-amber\">Line 2</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Actual Operation & Step Breakdown -->\n        <div class=\"flow-step-card\">\n          <div class=\"flow-card-header\">\n            <span class=\"flow-card-title\">Operation Being Executed</span>\n            <span id=\"flowScopeLabel\" style=\"font-family:var(--font-mono); font-size:11px; color:var(--accent-cyan);\"></span>\n          </div>\n          <div id=\"flowCodeStatement\" class=\"flow-code-pill\"></div>\n          <div id=\"flowStepSummary\" class=\"flow-step-explanation\"></div>\n\n          <div class=\"flow-details-row\">\n            <div class=\"flow-mini-box\">\n              <span class=\"flow-mini-label\">Variable Change (Before → After)</span>\n              <div id=\"flowBeforeAfter\" class=\"flow-mini-content\"></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"flow-mini-box\">\n              <span class=\"flow-mini-label\">Condition / Return Outcome</span>\n              <div id=\"flowConditionResult\" class=\"flow-mini-content\"></div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Visual Execution Path Flowchart -->\n        <div class=\"flowchart-box\">\n          <div class=\"panel-header\" style=\"height:30px;\">\n            <div class=\"panel-title\">Visual Execution Path &amp; Timeline</div>\n            <span id=\"executionSummaryTag\" style=\"font-size:11px; color:var(--accent-green);\"></span>\n          </div>\n          <div id=\"flowchartSvgWrap\" class=\"flowchart-svg-wrap\"></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- ==========================================\n         PANEL C: VARIABLE INSPECTOR & BUILT-IN QUESTIONS (RIGHT)\n         ========================================== -->\n    <section class=\"panel\" aria-label=\"Panel C: Variable Inspector\">\n      <div class=\"panel-header\">\n        <div class=\"panel-title\">Panel C: Variable Inspector</div>\n        <span id=\"activeScopeBadge\" class=\"brand-tag\">Global Scope</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"inspector-body\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:11px; color:var(--text-secondary);\">\n          Click any variable row below to inspect its complete value history across all steps:\n        </div>\n\n        <table class=\"var-inspector-table\" aria-label=\"Live Variable Inspector\">\n          <thead>\n            <tr>\n              <th>Variable</th>\n              <th>Previous</th>\n              <th>Current</th>\n              <th>Type</th>\n              <th>State</th>\n            </tr>\n          </thead>\n          <tbody id=\"varInspectorTbody\"></tbody>\n        </table>\n\n        <!-- Visual Array / List Memory Index Strip -->\n        <div id=\"visualListsContainer\"></div>\n\n        <!-- Selected Variable History Drawer -->\n        <div id=\"varHistoryBox\" class=\"var-history-box hidden\"></div>\n\n        <!-- Built-In Code Questions (Section 9 — Rule-Based, No AI) -->\n        <div class=\"questions-section\">\n          <div class=\"flow-mini-label\" style=\"margin-bottom:6px;\">Built-In Code Questions (Rule-Based)</div>\n          <div class=\"question-chips\" id=\"questionChips\">\n            <button class=\"q-chip\" data-qid=\"what_line_does\">What does this line do?</button>\n            <button class=\"q-chip\" data-qid=\"why_var_changed\">Why did this variable change?</button>\n            <button class=\"q-chip\" data-qid=\"why_cond_true\">Why is this condition True?</button>\n            <button class=\"q-chip\" data-qid=\"why_cond_false\">Why is this condition False?</button>\n            <button class=\"q-chip\" data-qid=\"what_happens_next\">What happens next?</button>\n            <button class=\"q-chip\" data-qid=\"why_loop_repeat\">Why did the loop repeat?</button>\n            <button class=\"q-chip\" data-qid=\"why_return_value\">Why did the function return this value?</button>\n            <button class=\"q-chip\" data-qid=\"what_if_change_input\">What happens if I change this input?</button>\n            <button class=\"q-chip\" data-qid=\"what_symbol_means\">What does this Python symbol mean?</button>\n          </div>\n          <div id=\"questionAnswerBox\" class=\"question-answer-box\">\n            Select any question above (or click a variable/line) to view its rule-based explanation.\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n  </main>\n\n  <!-- ==========================================\n       PANEL D: BEGINNER EXPLANATION (BOTTOM — 7 REQUIRED FIELDS)\n       ========================================== -->\n  <section class=\"beginner-explanation-panel\" aria-label=\"Panel D: Beginner Explanation\">\n    <div class=\"panel-header\">\n      <div class=\"panel-title\">\n        Panel D: Step-by-Step Rule-Based Explanation\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"explanation-modes\">\n        <span style=\"font-size:11px; color:var(--text-secondary); margin-right:4px;\">Explanation Level:</span>\n        <button class=\"mode-btn active\" data-mode=\"beginner\">Beginner Mode (Simple English)</button>\n        <button class=\"mode-btn\" data-mode=\"technical\">Technical Mode (Control Flow &amp; Runtime Detail)</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"explanation-cards-grid-7\">\n      <div class=\"exp-card\">\n        <div class=\"exp-card-title\">1. What Current Line Does</div>\n        <div id=\"exp1WhatLineDoes\" class=\"exp-card-body\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"exp-card\">\n        <div class=\"exp-card-title\">2. Important Symbols</div>\n        <div id=\"exp2Symbols\" class=\"exp-card-body\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"exp-card\">\n        <div class=\"exp-card-title\">3. Why Line Executes Now</div>\n        <div id=\"exp3WhyNow\" class=\"exp-card-body\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"exp-card\">\n        <div class=\"exp-card-title\">4. Variables Before Step</div>\n        <div id=\"exp4VarsBefore\" class=\"exp-card-body\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"exp-card\">\n        <div class=\"exp-card-title\">5. Changes After Step</div>\n        <div id=\"exp5ChangesAfter\" class=\"exp-card-body\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"exp-card\">\n        <div class=\"exp-card-title\">6. Why Condition is T/F</div>\n        <div id=\"exp6WhyCondition\" class=\"exp-card-body\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"exp-card\">\n        <div class=\"exp-card-title\">7. Next Line &amp; Why</div>\n        <div id=\"exp7NextLine\" class=\"exp-card-body\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <script src=\"engine.js\"></script>\n  <script src=\"explainer.js\"></script>\n  <script src=\"app.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n","Description":"Update index.html with Input Playground, Maximum Subarray preloaded, Built-In Code Questions, Practice Mode, and 7-card Beginner Explanation Panel","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\CVT\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\code-flow-visualizer\\index.html","toolAction":"Updating index.html for full 15-section spec","toolSummary":"Update index.html with Input Playground, Built-In Questions, and 7-part Explanation Panel"}}]}
