{"step_index":52,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-10T10:27:22Z","input_tokens":7021,"cache_read_tokens":159510,"output_tokens":2197,"thinking":"The task involves updating the stylesheet with CSS classes. These classes are for distinct UI elements: the input playground, validation feedback, question chips, practice mode card, array index visualization, and the beginner explanation panel. The goal is to ensure each element is styled correctly.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"Append":true,"CodeContent":"\n/* Input Playground Bar (Section 11) */\n.input-playground-bar {\n  height: 40px;\n  background-color: var(--bg-elevated);\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  padding: 0 16px;\n  gap: 12px;\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n}\n\n.playground-left,\n.playground-presets {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 6px;\n}\n\n.playground-label {\n  font-size: 11.5px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n  white-space: nowrap;\n}\n\n.playground-input {\n  width: 290px;\n  background: var(--bg-input);\n  color: var(--accent-cyan);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n  